OpenDMR includes code ported from RadioFoundry:

    https://github.com/gzalo/RadioFoundry
    Copyright (c) The RadioFoundry Authors

The ported code builds the Motorola LRRP report and the unconfirmed DMR IP packet (the CRC-32, the preamble CSBKs,
the data header and the Rate 1/2 blocks). It is in src/services/aprs_dmr.c, src/services/aprs_dmr.h and the
transmit-data parts of src/dmr/hr_c7000.c.

